Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 01:45:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Automatic sync, updates from GitHub Releases, desktop logo,
 README
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Auto sync with known devices on the same network; interval in settings (off, 5–60 min).
  Desktop accepts known devices in the background while running; phone syncs on open and by interval.
- Update check via GitHub Releases (can be turned off); release workflow builds APK and installers on a tag.
- Desktop: logo in the sidebar, icons for Windows (.ico) and macOS (.icns).
- README rewritten for the public repository; stale snapshot files removed.
